{"version":1,"content":"<p>【笑死 ⚠️】綠線災情一堆卻有空抽水！</p><p>Apple iPhone Duo 上市後陸續有用戶回報出現爆屏漏液等問題，Samsung 迅速展開猛烈宣傳攻勢，在北美地區出動大型流動廣告宣傳車，於 Apple Store 附近街頭巡迴，直接模擬 iPhone Duo 的屏幕損壞畫面，並宣傳自家的 Galaxy Z Fold8，呼籲受影響的消費者轉投三星陣營。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:10.636313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T14:30:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.065537+00:00","content_hash":"e279440e80792ae990abb4adf738bffcd6fbc3c85a165a980ca58f18921f91b2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}